    {
      "inventory_id": "BodyArmour1",
      "additional_text": "Feathered Raiment\n1. 10% of Damage is taken from Mana before Life\n2. +94 to maximum [EnergyShield|Energy Shield]\n3. 110% increased [EnergyShield|Energy Shield]\n4. +31 to [Intelligence|Intelligence]\n5. +29% to Fire and Chaos Resistances\n6. 40% increased [Armour|Armour], [Evasion|Evasion] and [EnergyShield|Energy Shield]\n7. 15% of Damage is taken from Mana before Life\n8. Can roll Soul modifiers\n9. [ShamanOnlyMods|Bonded]: +40 to maximum Life\n10. [ShamanOnlyMods|Bonded]: 3% increased maximum Life\n11. [ShamanOnlyMods|Bonded]: +40 to maximum Mana\n12. [ShamanOnlyMods|Bonded]: 3% increased maximum Mana\n13. [ShamanOnlyMods|Bonded]: 8% of Maximum Life [StatConversion|Converted] to [EnergyShield|Energy Shield]",
